tlbstacks (0.3.4-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Plasma 6.8 compatibility: the widget failed to load entirely because
    libplasma dropped PlasmaCore.WindowThumbnail; hover tiles now use the
    PipeWire stream as the sole live-thumbnail backend (faster hovers too).
  * Activity stacks no longer claim running windows — a merely-recent app's
    window can no longer vanish from the append zone.
  * Config editor: folder-path summaries guard against percent escape errors.

 -- Matt Philmon <mattisking@gmail.com>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 03:46:58 +0000

