tlbstacks (0.3.2-0obs1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Restore the group widget's task bridge: the taskLoader created by commit
    e76e27b pointed a relative Loader URL at a file that does not exist in
    the group package, killing all task tracking (running dots, counts,
    unclaimed tasks, click matrix, hover tiles, Close).

